# Only the code goes into the image. The settings come from the server
# (compose), never from a file: an image on Docker Hub is readable by anyone.
#
# credentials.json is not listed: db_connector.py opens it at start-up. It is
# not in git, production mounts it, and the end-to-end tests of VariaMosAdmin
# write an empty {} one before they build this image.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.key
*.pem

# Local tools and caches
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.http
